      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "わあ、ここがCDショップ！\nこれ、マスコットのヌイグルミ？　かわいいね！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "ピエール"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_b:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 30,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "どの棚も見やすく整理されてるし、\nポップのデザインも凝ってるな……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "鷹城 恭二"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_b:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 30,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ポップの内容もいいよ。\nほら、これとか……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_b:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 30,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "このアイドルは、世界観が前向きで明るいんだ。\n文章もデザインも、それをしっかり踏まえてる。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_b:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 30,
          "target_step_index": 10
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ちょうど試聴用のCDもあるね。\nピエール、よかったら聞いてごらん？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_b:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 30,
          "target_step_index": 11
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "うん！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "ピエール"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_b:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 30,
          "target_step_index": 14
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "わぁ……この曲、すっごくきらきら！\n恭二も、これ聞いてみて！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "ピエール"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_b:step-17:text",
        "step_id": 17,
        "step_index": 16,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 30,
          "target_step_index": 16
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "他の注目アイドルは……ん？\nあのボードは……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_b:step-24:text",
        "step_id": 24,
        "step_index": 23,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 30,
          "target_step_index": 23
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "「店員オススメの新人アイドル」？\n……えっ。俺たち、Beitの名前がある。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "鷹城 恭二"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_b:step-28:text",
        "step_id": 28,
        "step_index": 27,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 30,
          "target_step_index": 27
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "すごい！\nここにボクたちのこと、書かれてる！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "ピエール"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_b:step-29:text",
        "step_id": 29,
        "step_index": 28,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 30,
          "target_step_index": 28
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "この前話題になった動画のことだね。\n綺麗にレイアウトされてる……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_b:step-30:text",
        "step_id": 30,
        "step_index": 29,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
